  "details": "I am creating a DIY community space in VRChat and hope to scan members' DIY works from reality into 3D models for display in VRChat. \n\nWe have found Gaussian Splatting to be a high-quality 3D model generation technique, but its Unity script files are not allowed by VRChat, so we cannot upload the models. Therefore, we kindly request the VRChat team to allow us to upload this script along with the models. Thank you very much\n\nThis is the github address of the script file：      https://github.com/aras-p/UnityGaussianSplatting",
